From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:59:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3042/3799] soh: rename D_8098783C -> sCsRunning

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: overlay-wide latch that a cutscene was running, so its end can be detected next update
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Im/z_demo_im.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Im/z_demo_im.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Im/z_demo_im.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Im/z_demo_im.c
index 4ec315aac..ee40ecb92 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Im/z_demo_im.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Demo_Im/z_demo_im.c
@@ -91,7 +91,8 @@ static void* sEyeTextures[] = {
     gImpaEyeClosedTex,
 };
 
-static u32 D_8098783C = 0;
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_8098783C: overlay-wide latch that a cutscene was running, so its end can be detected next update
+static u32 sCsRunning = 0;  // was D_8098783C [LLM:HIGH]
 
 static ColliderCylinderInitType1 sCylinderInit = {
     {
@@ -164,7 +165,7 @@ void DemoIm_SetupHiddenAfterCs(DemoIm* this) {
 
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80984C8C: latches while a cutscene runs and hides the params 2 Impa when it ends
 void DemoIm_WatchCutsceneEnd(DemoIm* this, PlayState* play) {
-    u32* something = &D_8098783C;
+    u32* something = &sCsRunning;  // was D_8098783C [LLM:HIGH]
 
     if (play->csCtx.state == CS_STATE_IDLE) {
         if (*something != 0) {
